  "description": "A-Trail Ultra Motor Power & Performance eMTB 48v14ah 672wh Panasonic Cells\nBafang 30 Amp M620 Ultra Motor Mid Drive with Torque and Throttle 9s Deore Shifting, Rockshox Recon 150 and Monarch RT Rear Suspension, 27.5x3\" Trail Rated Alex Rims Wheels and More\nRange 20-45m Assisted Speed to 28mph\nA-Trail Ultra Walk-Through video (v17)\nBest in Class Ultra Powered Bicycle at an Unmatched Price\nEquipped with M620 160Nm Motor, Rockshox Suspension, Industry Leading Wheelset, Tektro e550 Brakes, Shimano Alivio/Deore Drivetrain and More. A longer-lasting, comfortable ride, and confident handling comes from better parts.\nM620 Ultra Motor\nStrong 160Nm of Hill Crushing Power, 5 Levels of Torque Activated Assist, and Throttle Operation. Paired with Narrow Wide Chain Ring and Shift Sensing for Smooth Shifting in any Condition.\nTrail-Ready Rockshox Air Suspension\nRockshox Recon 150mm and Monarch RT for smooth steering and commanding traction in any condition. Whether you're building a comfortable urban machine, or a trail hungry eMTB, the fully adjustable suspension from Rockshox is ready to ride anywhere and everywhere.\nDownhill Capable, Tubeless Ready Wheelset\nAlex Rims MD35, with 12/15mm Through-axles, running 27.5x3in Maxxis Chronicles. Ride with confidence through every turn and down any trail. A bike is only as good as its wheels, and the A-Trail delivers strength and lightweight \"plus\" wheels.\nUS Based Support and 2-year Warranty since 2011\nVolton stands behind the quality of Volton bikes with a 2-year parts warranty, and easy to reach US based general support. Since 2011 Volton has delivered fine electric bicycles, and works with a nationwide network of mechanics for assembly and maintenance service. Contact us today with any questions.",
